invariant: INV-16
file: x25519_wide_edwards.h
catches: x25519_equiv_test
reason: recode moves a digit of 8 or more into [-8, 7] and does not pass
  the 16 it took away to the digit above, so the digits sum to s minus 16
  times every carry. Almost every scalar gives a wrong key.

--- old
        e[i] += carry;
--- new
        e[i] += 0 * carry;
